253 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 64 0 R
/E (A members-only career fair connecting sponsors with IEEE UCF students and select partner engineering societies at UCF. Held each semester on a weekday afternoon during recruiting season, the fair sets up company tables around a large event space. All sponsors are invited. Knightro and Pegasus sponsors receive priority registration.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [10]
>>
